The '''Smoldering Tomb''' is a [[Location]] in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. It has a recommended {{Skill|Combat}} level of 30.

{{ZoneText|&eSlay really mean blazes.}}

== Features ==
=== Mobs ===
The '''Smoldering Tomb''' is meant be used to obtain {{Skl|Combat|XP}} for [[Blaze Slayer]]. {{MobSprite|Smoldering Blaze}}s spawn throughout the Tomb, and {{MobSprite|Millennia-Aged Blaze}}s spawn in the lower areas.

=== Resources ===
{{Item|Rough Opal Gemstone|text=Opal Gemstone}}s are generated naturally in the '''Smoldering Tomb'''.

[[Cinderbat Shard|Cinderbat Shards]] can be caught by using a [[Huntraps|huntrap]].

